  t('<b>Advocacy, strengthening</b>', 'studies: telecom <b>2021</b>, pharma <b>2022</b>, digital advertising <b>2023</b>', 'interoperability, data portability vs “walled gardens”', 'campaign “Fair Competition for a Vibrant Economy” (<b>2024</b>)', 'coordination with SEBI, RBI, MeitY; AI analytics for cartels, predatory pricing', 'offices in Bengaluru, Mumbai expanded', '<b>Google v. CCI (2023)</b>: NCLAT and SC upheld CCI orders; natural justice stressed', w=26),
  bx('ye', '<b>Handout alerts:</b> (1) penalty: 10% of average turnover cap, 2023 Act links to global turnover, yet challenges say it still needs operationalising. (2) DMDU launched 2024; way forward asks for a DMDU with forensic capability (strengthen it).'),
