  bx('ye', '<b>Handout alert:</b> additional NDMA functions from <b>Secs 12-14</b>, yet SDMA is under <b>Sec 14</b>. Use as written: 12-14 NDMA functions, 14 SDMA, 25 DDMA.'),
  sec('6 · SDMA', 'g'),
  bx('bl', '<b>Sec 14</b>; apex state body; <b>every State and UT with a legislature</b> must set one up. SDMAs link NDMA and DDMAs; adapt national policy to coastal, hilly, drought-prone States.'),
  bx('ca', '<span class="tag">In the news · July 2026 (verify dates)</span><b>Flood control:</b> in none of the three lists; drainage and embankments in State List Entry 17; DM Act, 2005 is the legal framework.'),
